WEBVTT

00:02:58.287 --> 00:03:01.791
Actually, it's not even two hours.
It's about 74 minutes.

00:03:01.815 --> 00:03:08.778
My battery sort of hits, "Oh, God, I just
have to get out of here and breathe."

00:03:08.802 --> 00:03:11.148
So, there's plenty of types
of social stimulation

00:03:11.172 --> 00:03:13.174
that introverts are actually great at.

00:03:13.198 --> 00:03:14.774
Draw that distinction for me.

00:03:14.798 --> 00:03:17.229
What is the difference between
social stimulation

00:03:17.253 --> 00:03:19.918
that an introvert actually is great at,

00:03:19.942 --> 00:03:22.389
versus what they get depleted by?

00:03:22.413 --> 00:03:25.826
SC: Yeah. And I don't want to say "great,"
because there are introverts

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:29.645
who are really great at any number
of types of social interactions.

00:03:29.669 --> 00:03:32.455
Everybody's got their different
ones that they like,